<section xml:id="important-dates">
  <title>Important Dates</title>

  <p>
    The following are the most significant university and course dates this term.
    For smaller course assignment due dates, check the <url href="https://framingham.instructure.com/">Canvas</url> and <url href="https://www.myopenmath.com/">MyOpenMath</url> calendars regularly.
  </p>

  <p>
    <dl width="wide">
      <li>
        <title>Monday, Sept 07</title>

        <p>
          No Class (Labor Day)
        </p>
      </li>

      <li>
