        <p>
          No Classes (Columbus Day / Indigenous Peoples' Day)
        </p>
      </li>


      <li>
        <title>Wednesday, Nov 11</title>

        <p>
          No Classes (Veterans Day)
        </p>
      </li>

      <li>
        <title>Wednesday, Nov 25</title>

        <p>
          Last Day to Withdraw with a W
        </p>
        <p>
          Last Day to Take a Course Credit/No Credit
        </p>
      </li>

      <li>
        <title>Nov 26-Nov 27</title>

        <p>
          No Classes (Thanksgiving Recess)
        </p>
      </li>


